{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_deepcl_set_2_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_deepcl_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "蓝调",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_deepcl_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "38d02939288fce6116f4add2be8172824a6f62ce49adb2bfa60f850347fb1dfe",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "滴答，滴答......\n画画，画画......\n滴答，滴答......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您好，有您的邮件！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "放在门口就行，谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "刚刚想好怎么下笔，这下全忘了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "不管了，一会再想吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "先去看看送来的是什么东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "一幅画？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "可我只会画画，不会买画，究竟是谁寄来的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "奇怪，收件人和寄件人都没写名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但深海色很明白，这幅画就是寄给她的。\n无论是用色，还是笔触，都让她感到熟悉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "虽然不知道是谁寄来的，但谢谢你的礼物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "于是，深海色将它放在了画架旁，随后重新开始了自己的创作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "过了许久，一幅画作完成，但那不是深海色所想的画，而是“那幅画”的临摹。\n她的注意力不断被那奇异的熟悉感吸走，这让她的眼睛不由自主离开画布让她的思维不断临摹画框里的色彩让她——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "或许我该休息一阵了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "今天也太热闹了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "你怎么来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "来看你画画，今天有新画吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "还没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "可画布上不是已经画了些东西吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "一条小溪，一片树林，一座木屋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "那是临摹的，有人送给了我一幅画，我的脑袋里都是它，下笔也只能临摹它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "临摹也是画啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "那是复制别人的思想与技法，只能算是练习，不能说是我的画。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "对我来说没什么区别，只要是用你的手拿着画笔蘸着颜料涂出来的信息，我都喜欢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "总之，今天不画了，走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "怎么了？你怎么也在看那幅画？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "我觉得......好熟悉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "你不这么觉得吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "因为这份亲切感我已经一笔都画不下去了，你要是喜欢的话，就把它带回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "可你已经见过它了，我带走它是没用的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "也是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "那我们该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "去调查？去探险？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "好像也没有别的办法了......就听你的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "好的，我们现在就出发！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "等、等等！你不准备一下吗？至少把这幅画带上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "你问我这个包裹是哪里来的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "是的，上面既没有写收件人也没有写寄件人，但这确实是我的包裹，所以我想询问一下，它是从哪里寄过来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "总不能是突然——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "对不起，我确实没有印象收到过这份邮包。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "我从外头回来，过检查的时候没有看到过这个包裹，你确定是我送的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "不过你别担心，我现在就去查，一定能给你一个答复的，说不定是人事那边的反诈骗演习呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "请稍等一会，我马上回来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "你跑到哪里去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "刚刚给我送包裹的信使先生说没有印象......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "我问了我的朋友，它们知道这幅画从哪里来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "是哪里来的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "顺着河流一路走，一路走，就能看到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "一条小溪，一片树林，一座木屋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "别逗了，大地上有这么多溪流，我怎么知道是哪一条啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "朋友们把位置告诉我了，我来给你带路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "好吧，你先在这里等我一会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "你去哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "我去拿画笔和画布。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "等等，先停一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "让我休息一会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "我们走了多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "几天？几周？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "你累了吗，需要我帮你背画画工具吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "不用，我是画家，这我还背得动......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "怎么了，你也想画画？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "我想，但我不会，学也学不会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "那就帮我准备颜料吧，反正都休息了，我想画一会画。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "还是不行吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "即使看着眼前截然不同的景色，深海色笔下画出的，仍是那幅画中的场景。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "现在这幅画不好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "虽然木屋还没画，但......太奇怪了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "明明颜料都不一样，为什么最后还是会画得分毫不差？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "你还在临摹吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "唉，是啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "画自然景色画得逼真也叫作临摹吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "那叫拟真。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "不一样吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "嗯，不一样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "那我觉得，你应当说自己是在拟真而不是在临摹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "能不能别混淆概念了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "你看看前面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "越过画布，深海色突然发现，眼前被画布挡住的景色，正是自己笔下刚绘制出的那一方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "这，怎么回事？我们眼前不应该是草地吗？哪里来的溪流？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "你画得真好，和自然一模一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "顺着这条小溪走下去，我们会不会就到目的地了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "或许吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "唉，真是越来越奇怪了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "帮我收下画架好吗，助手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "你在疑惑什么，深海色？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "我觉得......很熟悉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "还是那幅画吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "是这个地方，这片森林，这条小溪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "画里画的就是这个地方......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "我看到前面的小屋了，木制的，就是画里的那一座。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "终于到了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "就是这里吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "从我这个角度看，是一样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "那我们进去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "嗯，我在门口等你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "你不想进去看看吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "我进不去，我看不见门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "门就在这里，你看，我把它打开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "我还是什么都没看见，对不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "你去吧，我在这里等你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "那，你等我一会，我马上回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这屋子已经很久没有住人了，家具破败不堪，画作四处散落，所有东西都蒙上了厚厚一层灰。\n随之而来的，是如影随形的熟悉感，没有那幅画上的那么诡异，取而代之的，是亲切与眷恋。\n就像是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深海色随手拿起一幅画，抹去灰尘，露出残破的真相。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "当绘画成为生命，生活便堕落为毒药。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "除了顺流而下，再无选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "树林、溪流、木屋......怎么都是一模一样的画？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深海色取下一幅墙上的挂画，吹开枷锁，往事猛然挣脱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "听说远方有着为绘匠而备的天堂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "从此顺流而下，便能抵达。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "咳咳......这个椭圆画框不是肖像画才用的吗？怎么还是它？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "不会连素描本里也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深海色翻开桌上的素描本，纸张颤动，传达出陈旧的警示。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "画不出美的手，未见过美的心，未抵天堂，自毁近在咫尺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "顺流......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "果然......每一页都只有屋外的景色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "这座屋子的主人，大概是疯了吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "既然她画了这么多，那这一幅，也留给她好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "画落在脱毛的地毯上，发出一声闷响。\n它将在这里被遗忘，被尘埃淹没。\n直到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "她画下的最后一幅画，成为永恒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "你回来了，有什么发现吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "那幅画呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "丢屋子里了，我不想再记起它了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "那么，你能画画了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "那不还是只能画出同样的场景？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "不试试看怎么知道呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "嗯......也对，我试试看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "这不是同一幅画吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "不一样的，你看，这里的光线和角度，还有用色的方法都和那幅画有区别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "好像，缺了些什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "不是技巧上的问题......奇怪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "......你之前说，你的朋友告诉了你画从这里来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "是的，有什么问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "你的朋友，能够走进屋子吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "它们做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "那它们怎么能知道画的所在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "“顺流而下，在溪流的尽头。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "它们是这样说的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "溪流的尽头有什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "有屋子的主人想要的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "助手，这幅画你先帮我收起来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“辅助干员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "然后，我们可以沿着溪流走下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "溪流的尽头究竟有什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "助手，还有水吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "text": "只有眼前的海水了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "好饿......好累......没人想来这里画画吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "text": "画画？当然不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "text": "来这里是为了活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "text": "你看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "顺着助手所指的方向看去，能看到一堆杂乱的绘画工具。\n颜料早已干涸，木制画架碎落一地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "真可怜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "text": "别的地方已经没有她的容身之所了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "text": "而生存，是容不下杂质的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "text": "为了活下去，就得抛弃一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在一堆礁石中，深海色看到了一个熟悉的画框。\n支离破碎，濒临死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "这就是包裹里的那幅画......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "她想要把画送给我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "而我把它丢回了屋子里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "text": "是的，毕竟你已经不需要它了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "或许我该......留个纪念？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "text": "那我们可以把你的临摹寄回去，怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "就这样做吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "text": "那我们呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "我们继续前进。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "text": "这里已经是尽头了，你要去哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深海色踏入了海洋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "她被海洋带走了，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "text": "被海洋浸湿，就再也回不去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "她有得选吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_454_1",
      "text": "没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "那我想，我也没有，对吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "走吧，助手，做事得有始有终。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "灌满海洋的不是水。\n是墨，是油，是色彩。\n它浸润了深海色的每一根神经，刷去了她心中所有的情感。\n她变得纯粹，变得完美。\n许多声音同她一起鸣唱，呼喊着生存的和谐。\n她凑上前去，想要应和那声音。\n但她没唱，她拿起了笔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "鸣唱戛然而止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助手”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "text": "生存的表达不应是这样的，深海色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "我还活着，我想要画。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助手”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "text": "绘画没有防卫功效，绘画不能补充营养，这是种错误的生存逻辑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "是啊，可画画就是活着，我怎么能不画呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "笔尖蘸着海墨，色彩在水中飞舞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助手”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "text": "你忘记自己拥抱海洋的初衷了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "我当然记得，为了生存抛弃绘画，在那苦恨中走向末路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "所以她溺死了，我还活着，我要表达。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "不再抛弃色彩，不再舍离纸笔，我再也不愿停下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "一起来画吧，助手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助手”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "text": "我们应当积蓄能量，克服弱点，力求进化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "是啊，我们能够在绘画上更进一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助手”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "text": "那是进化的谬误。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "就算是吧，那又怎么样呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "我不会，也不想听从大群的呼唤。我将仅剩的自我全留给绘画。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "随着她的笔，她的涂抹，她的表达，海底逐渐铺满了色彩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "即使是海水，都抵挡不住这股宣泄。\n海水与油墨混合散开，不久后又搅到一起，循环往复，终究还是在这海洋中留下了烙印。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "快来，助手，我一个人可忙不过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "别让色块散开，把它聚拢到我这儿来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "你说什么？那些同胞走远了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "那是它们的大群，和我们，和我又有什么关系？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "调色完成了吗？海洋还等着我们为它染上色彩呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "助手，你还在吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "助手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "呼，就画到这里吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深海色面前的画布上，数个蓝色色块组成了画面的主体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "这是关于我们的故事，不过最后的处理是不是太过激烈了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "调色盘中伸展而出的细长腕足左右摇晃着，也不知道是在肯定还是在否定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "可能是因为海嗣的生活实在太压抑了，用些激进的表达方式来抗议那段生活，应该也无可厚非呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "那这幅画就结束了。我得把它盖好再处理一下，不然周边的干员再来投诉，人事部的人真的会把我从船上赶下去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "难得有一个不受那些家伙骚扰，能够安心画画的地方。我可不想再东躲西藏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "您好，有您的邮件！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "深海色干员对吧，这是您订的东西，一些绘画耗材和一个画框。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "是的，谢谢你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "请先确认一下，无误的话请在这里签个字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "是这里吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "好......嘞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "我还以为您的字也会是蓝色的呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "text": "那祝您今天生活愉快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "谢谢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "嘿咻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "speakerId": "avg_110_deepcl_1",
      "text": "那么，下一幅画什么好呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
